{:eval/lib :kotoba-ui, :eval/axis :axis/consistency, :eval/layer :llm-judge, :eval/score 5.00, :eval/judge "llm-judge-1", :eval/run-id "design-quality-20260713-0544", :eval/at "2026-07-13T05:44:03Z", :eval/seq 59, :eval/note "Matches the stated baseline closely and explicitly: single entry namespace with a hard rule that apps require only kotoba-ui.core (never shitsuke.*/liquid-glass.* directly, per both README and agent-guide's rule #1); theme-css emits '@layer kotoba.hig, kotoba.glass' exactly as the layer-order convention describes; dark-mode overrides (hig-dark-overrides/glass-dark-overrides/dark-css-variables) redeclare the same custom-property names under the appearance/media mechanism rather than minting new -dark variable names, matching the stated liquid-glass-ui convention; and kotoba-ui.core/shell/theme is precisely the 'wire shitsuke + liquid-glass behind ->page/shell so apps never require the lower layers' role described in the baseline, with appkit/uikit correctly deferred to sibling repos as the merge-opts layer on top (design.md explicitly documents this split)."}
